OL,3,GNEWSARAF teams take part in medical
OL,4,Ademonstrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Air Force (RAF) medics have taken
OL,7,Fpart in a public demonstration of their
OL,8,Fspecialist skills.
OL,10,FTactical Medical Wing (TMW), the
OL,11,Fforce's deployable specialist medical
OL,12,Fsupport, carried out a series of
OL,13,Fexercises in a hangar at RAF Brize
OL,14,FNorton on Tuesday.
OL,16,FWing Cdr Rosie Barrow, the officer
OL,17,Fcommanding TMW, told the BBC: "In the
OL,18,Flast month the guys have done some
OL,19,Fincredible missions just bringing
OL,20,Fpeople home to the UK."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
