OL,3,GNEWSARAF teams take part in medical
OL,4,Ademonstrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 200 personnel took part in the
OL,7,Ftraining drills, which featured an
OL,8,Foperation on a soldier injured in
OL,9,Fbattle, and on another suffering from
OL,10,Fappendicitis.
